subject: You've used 80% of your daily Detag quota

--- text ---
Hi,

You've used 80% of your daily quota on your Detag pro plan (8 of 10 images) for 2026-11-20.

When the quota is full, new jobs are rejected until tomorrow (UTC). See your usage at http://localhost:8080/billing, or upgrade any time at http://localhost:8080/plans.

— The Detag team

